---
/**
 * Explicit SRS §6.2 deviation, informed product-owner decision — see
 * docs/status/KNOWN_RISKS.md. Only ever rendered by MarketingLayout.astro,
 * and only when ALL of: `PUBLIC_APP_ENV === "production"`, the visitor has
 * granted analytics consent (docs/analytics/CONSENT_AND_ANALYTICS_PREFERENCE_MODEL.md),
 * and the current route is on the GA allowlist (apps/web/src/lib/consent.ts's
 * `isGaEligibleRoute` — never app/admin/billing/private-report/private-audit-
 * result routes). Never on the authenticated app/admin layouts, never in
 * local/preview, never before consent.
 *
 * Kept as its own component (rather than inlined in MarketingLayout) because
 * Astro's compiler cannot parse a `<script is:inline>` body containing `{}`
 * when the tag itself sits inside a `{condition && (...)}` JSX expression —
 * this file's `<script>` tags stay at the template root, so the caller only
 * ever nests a plain `<GoogleAnalytics />` element inside that expression.
 *
 * `page_location` is explicitly overridden to `origin + pathname` (never the
 * unfiltered `location.href`) so query strings, hashes, and any continuation/
 * report/audit token that might appear in a URL are never sent to Google —
 * see docs/analytics/GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_SCOPE_POLICY.md §"Query-string privacy".
 */
---

<script async is:inline src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-1W5HP7S561"></script>
<script is:inline>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag() {
    dataLayer.push(arguments);
  }
  // This component only ever renders after the visitor has granted
  // analytics consent, so analytics_storage is "granted" here — but
  // advertising-related signals stay explicitly denied regardless: CrawlPact
  // does not implement ad personalisation or Google Ads in this phase (see
  // docs/analytics/GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_SCOPE_POLICY.md).
  gtag("consent", "default", {
    analytics_storage: "granted",
    ad_storage: "denied",
    ad_user_data: "denied",
    ad_personalization: "denied",
  });
  gtag("js", new Date());
  gtag("config", "G-1W5HP7S561", {
    page_location: window.location.origin + window.location.pathname,
  });
</script>
